   "data": {
    "text": "EMOTIONAL ROAD\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 5, CC 81 to 92\n   1 Where this character is on their road\n   2 Where the film is on its road\n   3 Does the feeling turn\n   4 Hidden to shown\n   5 How far the feeling spreads\n   6 suite: Emotional road lens\n   7 suite: Rock bottom\n   8 pair: When a character reaches their lowest point, their feeling turns\n   9 pair: After a low scene, a laugh\n  10 pair: A hidden feeling bursts out later\n  11 pair: After tension peaks, release follows\n  12 pairs: Emotional rollercoaster"
   },
   "pos": [
    0,
    0
   ]
  },
